# Create a room and show its QR invite. Rendered by docs/demos/record.sh.
Output docs/assets/demos/create-room.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Framerate 24

Hide
Type "clear && visper" Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "n"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "y"
Sleep 3s
Ctrl+P
Sleep 4s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
